WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
What does Learn leave to you?

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:05.442
Its Validate query reads one
policy; an estate has several,

3
00:00:05.442 --> 00:00:09.638
on two services, so the kit reads
them all with the same checks.

4
00:00:09.638 --> 00:00:14.881
Front Door says body inspection is enabled
where Application Gateway says true,

5
00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:19.812
and code written for one reads the other
as off, so each shape is read as its own.

6
00:00:19.812 --> 00:00:23.114
A policy that requires a
WAF audits resources but

7
00:00:23.114 --> 00:00:26.174
doesn't count endpoints,
so the kit counts them.

8
00:00:26.174 --> 00:00:31.425
A Front Door's WAF lives in a security
policy, so those are read per profile.

9
00:00:31.425 --> 00:00:34.422
The switch to prevention,
sent by automation,

10
00:00:34.422 --> 00:00:37.825
blocks users before tuning,
so it's written to a plan.

11
00:00:37.825 --> 00:00:42.380
And an old rule set is a warning,
because moving needs validation first.
